These are the following categories of citizens:
-individuals who do not have formal vocational education but possess professional skills acquired through life experience;
-individuals who have completed non-formal education courses and wish to obtain an official document confirming their knowledge and skills;
individuals who have received formal vocational education and seek to validate a higher level of qualification;
-unemployed individuals, potential migrants, foreign citizens, and other groups interested in validating their professional skills and obtaining an official document for further professional development.
